  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">REKONEKTE (Reconnexion psychosociale, hygi&#xe9;nique et communautaire pour les populations urbaines d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es en Haiti)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The REKONEKTE project aims to improve the living conditions, mental health, and community cohesion for displaced men and women living in informal urban camps across the Port-au-Prince metropolitan area. Anchored in a multisectoral humanitarian response, the initiative combines the distribution of essential items, mobile psychosocial support, community engagement activities, and solar lighting to restore dignity, promote well-being, and strengthen resilience.Implemented in collaboration with loca</narrative>
  </description>
